# Rust
target/
Cargo.lock
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Fuzzing (cargo-fuzz): the corpus is regenerated per run and grows without
# bound; crash artifacts are reproducers for a local failure, and one worth
# keeping belongs in a test, not in this directory.
**/fuzz/corpus/
**/fuzz/artifacts/
**/fuzz/coverage/

